   "type": "static",
   "content": "Death Wish Coffee Company is an American coffee brand founded in 2012 by Mike Brown in Saratoga Springs, New York. Marketed as a strong, high-caffeine brew, the company produces USDA Organic and Fair Trade Certified coffee.\nCoffee Blend and Caffeine\n- Bean Blend: Uses a combination of high-caffeine Robusta and smooth Arabica beans sourced from regions like India, Peru, and Central/South America.\n- Caffeine Strength: Contains significantly more caffeine than a standard cup of coffee (often reported around 470 mg per 8-ounce cup, depending on the brew method).\n- Flavor Profile: Designed to be bold yet smooth, featuring low acidity and notes of chocolate, cherry, or caramel rather than harsh bitterness. Opinions on Reddit Reddit Discussion",
